"Later, Stella weaves Fly for others from a scroll schematic, taking about fifteen minutes each."
"Later, Stella builds capacitor spells of force that back her other constructs."
"Later, Stella learns to shape all her spells, even steering the blast of a great spell."
"Later, Stella can infuse spells with wizardry so they act semi-independently."
"Later, Stella's staff from a Questor's vault duplicates a spell into several copies."
"Later, Badud's damaged spellcasting loses its automagic."
"Years later, a newcomer to magic learns strong spells in a month of training."
"Years later, shield bracelets exist that trigger against heat, even one's own spell."
